# nanopb field options for ubo_client.proto.
#
# Global pointer/malloc mode: every string, bytes, repeated, submessage and
# optional scalar becomes a heap pointer. This keeps RAM proportional to the
# data actually present (view messages are small and transient) and avoids
# fixed max-size truncation of long text (notification content, text_viewer).
# Requires PB_ENABLE_MALLOC; pb_release() frees a decoded message.
* type:FT_POINTER
